DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Portland Book Week with LZR (Little Zine Revolution)!\n\nAssemble anti-colonial zines.  No experience necessary.\n\nCheck out OUR LFDL reference library!\n\nFREE zines & ICE-alert whistles\n\nAll are welcome!
